     "doc_unit_id": "mintlify:docs-mintlify/supported-files.mdx#intro",
     "diff": {
      "path": "docs-mintlify/supported-files.mdx",
      "before": "---\ntitle: \"Supported files\"\ndescription: \"Which file types Relay accepts and the 10 MB size limit that applies.\"\nowner: \"docs\"\nfacts:\n  limit.upload.csv.max_bytes: \"10240 KB\"\n---\n\nRelay analyzes delimited text files. This page states the mechanical limits;\nfor guidance on preparing a file, see the help center.\n\n## Size limits\n\n{/* concord:fact key=limit.upload.csv.max_bytes */}\nMaximum file size: 10 MB. Files over the limit are rejected before upload\nwith a clear error, not truncated.\n\n## Supported types\n\nRelay accepts `.csv` (comma-separated) and `.tsv` (tab-separated) files.\nExcel workbooks (`.xlsx`) are not supported — this is a deliberate product\ndecision, not a missing feature: export a single sheet to CSV first.\n",
      "after": "---\ntitle: \"Supported files\"\ndescription: \"Which file types Relay accepts and the 10 MB size limit that applies.\"\nowner: \"docs\"\nfacts:\n  limit.upload.csv.max_bytes: \"10240 KB\"\n---\n\nRelay analyzes delimited text files. This page states the mechanical limits;\nfor guidance on preparing a file, see the help center.\n\nA CSV upload may be at most 26,214,400 bytes (25 MiB).\n\n## Size limits\n\n{/* concord:fact key=limit.upload.csv.max_bytes */}\nMaximum file size: 10 MB. Files over the limit are rejected before upload\nwith a clear error, not truncated.\n\n## Supported types\n\nRelay accepts `.csv` (comma-separated) and `.tsv` (tab-separated) files.\nExcel workbooks (`.xlsx`) are not supported — this is a deliberate product\ndecision, not a missing feature: export a single sheet to CSV first.\n",
      "unified": "--- a/docs-mintlify/supported-files.mdx\n+++ b/docs-mintlify/supported-files.mdx\n@@ -12,0 +12,2 @@\n+A CSV upload may be at most 26,214,400 bytes (25 MiB).\n+\n"
     },
     "origin": "model_editorial_draft",
